7
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:09,220
Et si ta carte vendait à ta

8
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:09,540
place,

9
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:11,140
directement sur la table ?

10
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:11,360
Demain,

11
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:12,500
je te montre comment.

12
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:13,280
Commente MENU,

13
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:14,460
je t'envoie le lien.
